<title>CHINA: CIBC sets warrants on transport stocks basket.</title>
<headline>CIBC sets warrants on transport stocks basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London branch of the Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce said on Tuesday it has launched 360 million American-style call warrants on a basket of transport stocks. Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Citybus Group Ltd			  0.18 shrs</p>
<p> China Eastern Airlines Corp Ltd	0.75 shrs</p>
<p> Shanghai Hai Xing Shipping Co Ltd    0.3 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$3.722	PREMIUM	 24.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.1435     GEARING	 2.88x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	5.AUG.97	MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 5.AUG.98	LISTING	 HONG KONG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT   HK$4.1355</p>
<p> NOTE		 PHYSICAL OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>			DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
